}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "rec", "content": ""}]}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1}], "id": 5}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "The next thing is you must dress professionally."}]}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "engenn10le06ob01re3aud04"}], "id": 1}], "id": 6}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "rec", "content": ""}]}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1}], "id": 7}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "You need to be figure out what is going on, both officially and unofficially. "}]}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "engenn10le06ob01re3aud05"}], "id": 1}], "id": 8}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "rec", "content": ""}]}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1}], "id": 9}], "id": 11}], "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"type": "audio", "title": "", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le06ob01re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn10le06ob01re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Here's your cappuccino, Kristi. Are you nervous about our first day?<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Thanks. I'm a bit stressed.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: We needn't feel stressed.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: It helps that we're starting together on the same day.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: While I was on the bus, I did an internet search about how to make a good impression on your first day at work. I found 5 tips.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Oh, cool. What did you find out?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: The first thing is you need to have a positive attitude. Nothing works better than having and expressing a positive attitude as soon as you start the day. You mustn't bring non-work problems to the office.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: We know that's true.", "id": 1}, {"time": "31200", "image": "engenn10le06ob01re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: The next thing is you must dress professionally. Since people don't have an established idea of your abilities yet, they may make judgments based on what you wear in the first few weeks.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Too late to change today.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: You look great. The next thing is to show team spirit.  We are now part of a team, and teams work together to solve problems and get the job done. You will show loyalty to your co-workers by sharing credit with the team.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I totally believe that.", "id": 2}, {"time": "58800", "image": "engenn10le06ob01re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: The fourth things is learn co-workers names quickly. You might repeat the person's name to help you remember it. You could also use memory-aid techniques, like associating a person's name with some personal feature.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Ever since I forgot Mr. Brody's name during the interview, I've realized I need to work on that.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: The last tip is to listen more than you talk. You need to figure out what is going on, both officially and unofficially. To do that, you must listen carefully to what people say or don't say, and be observant.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: It sounds like you have great ideas for your first article!", "id": 3}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le06ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le06ob01re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1}]}]}